s=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a>，包括其中明确的空指标本地扩展。以下定义集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I)):\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I)):\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷 p.213 超滤子定义的有界集合包装；不存在独立的原书 4.1.2b。极大真滤子的等价刻画是原书命题4.1.2，存在性另由命题4.1.3给出，均不是本集合包装的定义条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 是任意集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]，包括其中明确的空指标本地扩展。以下定义集合 $\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I)):\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\}.","dis